      {
        "id": 2839035326,
        "content": "### Time Estimate\n- [x] I have added a time estimate label\n### Background Information\nResults from searching `ethers.js` and `typescript` in:\n`Pipfile, requirements.txt, package.json, go.mod, pom.xml, build.gradle, Gemfile, Cargo.toml, .cabal, composer.json, hardhat.config, truffle, network, deployments, foundry.toml`\n25 active teams:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1eb7e3a1-cc7c-49a7-b0d8-17104e752558)\n213 active contributors:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83eab632-c667-4611-b4c0-6a05f9a9c62f)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dffb5e5e-8ec0-49c3-86f2-6da77d31d699)\nWe will push all leads through the highlighted path as follows:\n<img width=\"715\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23a775c0-9d4d-45cc-bab0-535dc9a8a15b\" />\n1. Export OpenQ tables with (which contain some email addresses, all GitHub handles and some X handles) \n2. Enrich with Clay (maybe also nReach for tgs) as follows: \n| Input Data     | Potential Enriched Data                                                                 |\n|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Email Address  | LinkedIn Profile, X (formerly Twitter) Handle, Instagram Profile, Phone Number, Company Details |\n| GitHub Handle  | Email Address, LinkedIn Profile, X Handle, Personal Website, Company Information         |\n| X Handle       | Email Address, LinkedIn Profile, Instagram Profile, Personal Website, Company Information |\n3. Push into HubSpot for a centralized contact list\n4. Launch:\n  4a. a manual or automated GitHub campaign \n  4b. an automated Email campaign (smartleads) \n  4c. an automated LinkedIn campaign\n  4d. if we get TGs, an nReach campaign\n### Completion Criteria\nGoal is:\nto devpool.directory. (in order to measure performance, I would like to add google analytics if we don't have it already to monitor any upticks in traffic. or maybe we just track anybody that joins the tg group)\nwe qualify them and then invite them to book a call on the ubiquity calendly once they show enough interest and we answer all basic questions\nComplete when all campaigns are launched.\n### Relevant Links\n#116",
